# Git attributes for Planar Nexus (epic #2487).
#
# Test-count docs are ratcheted by `npm run ratchet:test-count` after a
# successful test run, so two PRs that each ratchet the same doc on different
# commits will conflict at the anchored block (#1902, #1910). Keep the merge
# trivial: always keep the current side (the side being merged INTO), so the
# next `npm run ratchet:test-count` rewrites the block to the latest live
# numbers. Do not weaken `test-count-docs-guard`: it still fails the build when
# the doc drifts away from the live Jest run, so a stale block never ships.
#
# Local one-liner after a rebase: `npm run ratchet:test-count`.

# Custom driver: keeps the current side and exits 0 (no conflicts).
[attr] keepcurrent merge=keepcurrent
docs/onboarding.md keepcurrent
docs/TEST_VIDEO_FIXTURES.md keepcurrent